      "content": "Wait, the X-2s are ground vehicles, not aircraft. What do you mean about pilots and skies? \n\nAnyway, back to the ground fleet—I'm looking at some preliminary telemetry showing some weird braking patterns in the X-2 series. Are the sensors picking up anything unusual regarding braking or deceleration?",
